  "DescIdentified": {
    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "0": "Arwen's bow is a masterpiece of Rivendell craftsmanship, balanced to move as naturally as a limb. Its wood remains supple, providing a constant supply of shafts for the one who draws it. Shadows cling to the wood, granting keen sight of the unseen."
    }
  },
  "Description": {
